  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Micro Irrigation Lean Farming Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To aid efficient farming with minimum water use through drip irrigation.

- Installation of efficient irrigation technology and equality in water distribution to farmers of Mandi village in Madhya Pradesh. Coverage of 30 hector under efficient water management system by establishment of 6 hydropas units.
- 10 farmers covered under training and capacity building.
- 50 farmers introduced to superior irrigation method using hydropas.</narrative>
  </description>
